@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - Booking State Machine

hide empty description

[*] --> PENDING : create booking\n[room inventory available]

state PENDING
state CONFIRMED
state CHECKED_IN
state CHECKED_OUT
state CANCELLED
state EXPIRED
state NO_SHOW

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : payment confirmed\n[before expiredAt]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : guest cancels
PENDING --> EXPIRED : payment timeout\n[now >= expiredAt]

CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : receptionist checks in\n[arrival window, early reason if needed, correct AVAILABLE room without conflict]
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancellation accepted\n[policy allows]
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : staff confirms absence\n[cutoff reached, no active approved hold, fee preview verified]

CHECKED_IN --> CHECKED_OUT : receptionist checks out\n[scheduled date reached, late note if needed, final debt zero]

CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CHECKED_OUT --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  A newly created booking holds inventory
  until configured expiry, default 15min.
  At exact expiry no confirmation/hold,
  even before scheduler writes EXPIRED.

  Counted in availability while:
  status = PENDING and expiredAt > now.
end note

note right of CONFIRMED
  Payment has been confirmed.
  Physical room assignment may happen
  before or during check-in.
end note

note right of CHECKED_IN
  The assigned physical room is OCCUPIED.
  Overdue occupancy still blocks inventory.
  No automatic checkout or extra-night fee.
  Cancellation is no longer permitted.
end note

note right of CHECKED_OUT
  The guest has left.
  The room becomes DIRTY. This is the
  terminal successful booking state.
end note

note right of NO_SHOW
  Retain the approved first-night fee (manager may reduce/waive).
  Release remaining inventory; keep original price snapshots.
  Refunds are tracked separately and may still be pending.
  No occupancy or dirty-room transition.
end note

note bottom of CANCELLED
  Booking was cancelled explicitly or invalidated.
  Inventory hold is released.
  Refund handling, when applicable,
  belongs to the payment lifecycle.
end note

note bottom of EXPIRED
  Payment was not confirmed before expiredAt.
  The RoomType inventory hold is released.
  No physical Room needs to be unassigned.
end note

legend bottom
  == Transition guard examples ==
  [room inventory available] : availability is rechecked inside a transaction
  [before expiredAt]          : expired bookings cannot be confirmed
  [policy allows]             : cancellation policy is satisfied
endlegend

@enduml
